WEBVTT

1
00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:27.000
My god,
brother what have you done?

2
00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:47.100
Yet again we arrived
to witness this monster's aftermath

3
00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:53.501
I will not tolerate this
any longer Markus

4
00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:55.200
Your brother must be stopped!

5
00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:59.300
- It ends tonight
- We must move quickly before they turn

6
00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:07.200
- Is he still here?
- Yes...

7
00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:09.400
Viktor...
He must not be harmed

8
00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.100
I gave you my word
did I not?

9
00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:16.100
But William must be controlled

10
00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:21.300
Burn the bodies!
Search the outbuilding!

11
00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:28.300
Markus!
Stay with me

12
00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.000
Give me the torch

13
00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:15.600
They're changing!

14
00:04:49.501 --> 00:04:51.000
Retreat to the woods!

15
00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:52.600
I will stay and fight!
You need my help!

16
00:04:52.601 --> 00:04:54.300
I need you alive

17
00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:57.800
If you die, we all die
Now go!

18
00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:24.100
- We found him
- ..and?

19
00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:28.000
- We need more men
- Find Amelia

20
00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:39.200
Amelia, we found William

21
00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:22.100
Leave him be!

22
00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:28.100
Stop this, you're killing him!

23
00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.200
More!

24
00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.400
William

25
00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.400
Markus!

26
00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:02.100
He was not to be harmed!

27
00:07:02.101 --> 00:07:05.900
Place him in my charge as we agreed
or you will pay for your deceit

28
00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:08.900
And you will learn your place

29
00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.100
Your sympathy for this beast
is foolish

30
00:07:11.102 --> 00:07:14.700
Your brother is entirely
beyond control

31
00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:16.501
It will be done my way

32
00:07:16.509 --> 00:07:19.570
You know well the consequences
if you murder me or William

33
00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:26.500
If you so much as speak his name again you
will have chosen that future for him

34
00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:35.800
What is thy will...

35
00:07:36.900 --> 00:07:37.900
... my lord

36
00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:44.200
Imprisonment for all time

37
00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.200
Far from you

38
00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:59.400
For 6 centuries I was a loyal
soldier of the Vampire clan

39
00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:03.100
But I was betrayed

40
00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:07.200
The war was not as it had seemed

41
00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:13.199
In one night the lies that have
united our kind has been exposed

42
00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:19.300
Craven our second in command had
formed a secret alliance with Lucian...

43
00:08:19.302 --> 00:08:21.800
...ruler of the Werewolf clan...

44
00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.900
... to overthrow Viktor, our leader

45
00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:28.700
But Craven's lust for power and
domination had failed

46
00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:32.200
Viktor is not the savior
I had lead to believe

47
00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.800
He had betrayed us all

48
00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:45.800
Soon the hunt will be on
for his killer

49
00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:53.600
I have but one ally left,
Michael

50
00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:57.100
The human descendent of Corvinus

51
00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:01.400
Not a Vampire nor Lycan
but a hybrid

52
00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:08.100
It's only a matter of time
before we're found

53
00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:31.000
My only hope now is to
awaken Markus...

54
00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:36.100
... our last remaining elder
and expose the truth

55
00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:39.300
before Craven tries to murder
him while still in hibernation

56
00:09:42.506 --> 00:09:44.700
Craven knows he is no match
for him awake

57
00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:57.100
This thing has been dead
for weeks

58
00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:59.700
I thought lycans went back to
their human form when they died

59
00:10:59.701 --> 00:11:04.990
They do, this one's been given a
serum to stop regression so it can
be studied

60
00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:06.400
How can you tell?

61
00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:16.100
- Not quite your department I guess
- I just kill them...

62
00:11:16.102 --> 00:11:18.900
... don't pay much attention
to their anatomy

63
00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:21.500
- How long can we stay here?
- Not long

64
00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:24.700
These safe houses are all linked
together on one mainframe...

65
00:11:24.702 --> 00:11:26.800
... motion sensors say which
ones are active

66
00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:29.100
Someone could have picked us
up already

67
00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:39.300
It's only about an hour to daylight

68
00:11:39.301 --> 00:11:41.700
Can you even make it back to
the mansion before sunrise?

69
00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:42.700
Just

70
00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:44.700
Ok, let's get what we need and go

71
00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:45.800
No

72
00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:49.300
I'm going alone

73
00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:08.900
Open it

74
00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:56.800
- Markus...
- The blood memories of this wretched creature...

75
00:13:57.400 --> 00:14:01.400
... has shown me that your
treachery knows no bounds

76
00:14:03.500 --> 00:14:05.900
My lord, I can explain

77
00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:12.000
Why should I listen to your lies?
When the journey to the truth...

78
00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:18.800
... is so much sweeter

79
00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:28.600
I kept the secrets

80
00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:32.600
Cleaned up the mess
"You will go before Viktor..."

81
00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:34.400
"... and tell him exactly what
I tell you to"

82
00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.900
Please ... I can assist you

83
00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:53.100
Oh you already have

84
00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:03.900
If I complete my case there's a
chance you'll be granted sanctuary

85
00:15:03.901 --> 00:15:06.300
Right now you'll be killed on sight

86
00:15:06.401 --> 00:15:08.600
- Not willing to risk it
- What am I supposed to do sit here and wait?

87
00:15:08.600 --> 00:15:11.000
Craven may still have his men with him,
you're not going alone

88
00:15:11.001 --> 00:15:14.300
- You're not as strong as you might think
- What?

89
00:15:14.302 --> 00:15:15.500
Michael, you're unique

90
00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:18.501
There has never been a hybrid before

91
00:15:18.501 --> 00:15:21.800
However ambivalent you are about it,
The truth is your powers may be limitless

92
00:15:21.801 --> 00:15:24.800
You depend on blood, you need
to feed

93
00:15:25.401 --> 00:15:28.700
Without it you will be growing
weaker by the second, use the time for that

94
00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:35.400
Jesus Christ... and what if I don't?
Or if I can't?

95
00:15:35.401 --> 00:15:36.400
It could be lethal

96
00:15:36.401 --> 00:15:39.700
If you don't anticipate your cravings,
you will attack humans

97
00:15:39.701 --> 00:15:44.100
And believe me you don't want
that on your conscience

98
00:15:44.101 --> 00:15:46.900
There really is no going back Michael

99
00:15:48.100 --> 00:15:49.500
I'm Sorry

100
00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:54.100
Look I understand what you did,
I'm grateful

101
00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:57.800
You saved my life

102
00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:00.700
I wasn't ready to die

103
00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:08.100
Everything has changed...

104
00:16:08.101 --> 00:16:14.000
... I probably needed a minute to think
the process all at once

105
00:16:14.001 --> 00:16:17.900
Look, go, I'll be here

106
00:16:18.001 --> 00:16:20.900
Just make sure you come back

107
00:17:41.000 --> 00:17:41.900
Sir

108
00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:46.200
Witness has been silenced?

109
00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:49.800
But otherwise unharmed as ordered

110
00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:55.200
- Show me what you have
- Yes sir

111
00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:04.300
2 Death Dealers we killed,
we found no lycan bodies

112
00:18:04.301 --> 00:18:09.600
Apparently they we using some kind of
new ammunition, some sort of UV round

113
00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:11.400
Amelia?

114
00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.300
No one survived

115
00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:20.200
It seems Craven's men may have been present
but did nothing to prevent it

116
00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:22.000
and Viktor?

117
00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:48.200
- No trace of Markus amongst the ashes?
- It seems he has destroyed his own coven

118
00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:51.300
It was never his coven

119
00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:15.400
"We need to go"

120
00:19:57.400 --> 00:19:58.800
Give me a moment

121
00:23:13.900 --> 00:23:15.000
How ya' doing

122
00:23:35.800 --> 00:23:36.490
Thank you

123
00:24:42.500 --> 00:24:44.200
"... Michael Corvin ..."

124
00:27:33.700 --> 00:27:34.200
Michael

125
00:27:43.100 --> 00:27:45.700
- Here, take it
- No

126
00:27:45.900 --> 00:27:47.300
Michael you'll die

127
00:28:14.300 --> 00:28:15.600
Can you move?

128
00:28:20.400 --> 00:28:21.400
We need to go

129
00:28:41.700 --> 00:28:45.000
- Markus
- I know what you've done, Selene

130
00:28:45.800 --> 00:28:48.600
Viktor deserved his fate
Craven was no better

131
00:28:48.602 --> 00:28:53.700
Craven has already reaped the rewards
of his own misdeeds

132
00:28:54.000 --> 00:28:57.700
and Viktor, he deserved his fate...

133
00:28:58.000 --> 00:29:00.400
... many times over

134
00:29:01.500 --> 00:29:05.100
A terrible business the slaying
of your family

135
00:29:06.100 --> 00:29:11.100
Yet so much effort was spent to
conceal this from me

136
00:29:12.400 --> 00:29:15.000
What do you suppose Viktor
had to hide?

137
00:29:16.100 --> 00:29:19.300
Or perhaps, it is you Selene

138
00:29:21.500 --> 00:29:27.600
As the last of your wretched family
who has something to hide

139
00:29:37.200 --> 00:29:37.800
Go!

140
00:31:18.501 --> 00:31:23.100
Dead or alive, you will give
me what I want

141
00:32:32.800 --> 00:32:34.500
You okay?

142
00:32:37.800 --> 00:32:40.500
- He's a hybrid isn't he?
- Yes

143
00:32:41.100 --> 00:32:43.400
He wanted this
Why?

144
00:32:44.300 --> 00:32:46.501
I don't know

145
00:32:46.508 --> 00:32:50.400
But we have another problem

146
00:32:53.900 --> 00:32:56.800
Turn off up here

147
00:33:00.900 --> 00:33:01.800
Get down

148
00:33:02.900 --> 00:33:05.700
Keep your foot on the gas
and stay down!

149
00:33:19.800 --> 00:33:20.500
Hold on!

150
00:34:48.000 --> 00:34:49.500
Give me your hand

151
00:34:50.600 --> 00:34:52.700
Jesus Christ

152
00:34:53.400 --> 00:34:55.700
- There's really no need
- Be right back

153
00:35:12.300 --> 00:35:14.100
Let me see

154
00:35:18.100 --> 00:35:19.000
See...

155
00:35:19.100 --> 00:35:21.498
...no need

156
00:39:00.600 --> 00:39:01.900
Area secure sir

157
00:40:25.600 --> 00:40:28.300
The sun is setting

158
00:40:28.800 --> 00:40:31.000
What's wrong?

159
00:40:36.800 --> 00:40:39.900
If supplies were taken used
weapons were left behind

160
00:40:39.901 --> 00:40:43.000
they couldn't have gone very far

161
00:40:43.001 --> 00:40:46.800
Remain airborne for the moment
I'm sure they will re-appear

162
00:40:46.801 --> 00:40:47.400
Yes sir

163
00:40:52.100 --> 00:40:54.800
I've seen this before when
I was a child

164
00:40:55.500 --> 00:40:58.700
I've held it when it was
open like this

165
00:40:58.701 --> 00:41:00.100
How is that possible?

166
00:41:01.400 --> 00:41:02.700
I don't know

167
00:41:05.700 --> 00:41:08.200
But I know someone that might

168
00:41:08.200 --> 00:41:12.300
Andreas Tanis, he was the official
historian of the covens

169
00:41:15.500 --> 00:41:19.300
He fell from favor after documenting
what Viktor considered malicious lies

170
00:41:19.301 --> 00:41:21.800
Of course as it turns out he's
been telling the truth

171
00:41:21.900 --> 00:41:26.000
- What happened to him?
- He was exiled over 300 years ago

172
00:41:26.001 --> 00:41:29.800
300 years?  What makes you think
we're going to find him now?

173
00:41:29.801 --> 00:41:32.200
I was the one who exiled him

174
00:42:08.900 --> 00:42:13.000
- Looks like a monastery
- It used to be, more like a prison now

175
00:42:13.401 --> 00:42:15.800
Tanis has been hiding there since
Viktor's order

176
00:42:15.801 --> 00:42:18.800
We're the most people he'd
seen in centuries

177
00:42:29.700 --> 00:42:31.700
- That's odd
- What?

178
00:42:32.100 --> 00:42:35.200
I don't remember this
gate being here before

179
00:42:36.800 --> 00:42:38.500
Take this

180
00:44:05.000 --> 00:44:05.600
Go back!

181
00:44:08.400 --> 00:44:09.000
Got you

182
00:44:12.400 --> 00:44:13.000
Fuck

183
00:46:41.300 --> 00:46:43.000
I knew it was you Selene

184
00:46:43.300 --> 00:46:47.300
The stench of Viktor's blood
still lingers in your veins

185
00:46:47.301 --> 00:46:50.700
Tanis, I see your aim hasn't improved

186
00:46:52.600 --> 00:46:56.500
You haven't changed
You don't scare me Selene

187
00:46:57.500 --> 00:47:00.400
Well we're going to have
to work on that

188
00:47:09.100 --> 00:47:10.100
We need to talk

189
00:47:14.600 --> 00:47:17.600
Your exile seems a bit more
comfortable than I remember

190
00:47:17.700 --> 00:47:21.200
- How does a Vampire have Lycan bodyguards?
- A gift

191
00:47:21.400 --> 00:47:24.300
From a most persuasive client

192
00:47:24.400 --> 00:47:25.500
Lucian

193
00:47:27.000 --> 00:47:29.000
Why would Lucian want to protect you?

194
00:47:29.700 --> 00:47:32.200
Because he was trading with them

195
00:47:33.700 --> 00:47:38.800
UV rounds, how long have you been in
the business of killing your own kind

196
00:47:38.802 --> 00:47:40.500
I've done what's necessary to survive

197
00:47:41.300 --> 00:47:45.300
My decision was easy once your
precious Viktor betrayed me

198
00:47:45.700 --> 00:47:48.200
Betrayal was something he did
very well

199
00:47:49.900 --> 00:47:52.100
Viktor's dead
I killed him

200
00:47:52.700 --> 00:47:55.000
You?  Killed Viktor?

201
00:47:59.600 --> 00:48:01.300
No I think not

202
00:48:03.800 --> 00:48:06.700
Oh unless you've learned the truth

203
00:48:10.700 --> 00:48:13.100
So your eyes are finally open

204
00:48:14.200 --> 00:48:18.800
Ain't it interesting that the truth
is even harder to absorb than lies

205
00:48:18.801 --> 00:48:25.200
You know I tried to stop him of course,
a travesty committing such a horrible crime

206
00:48:25.201 --> 00:48:28.600
And then turning you
That was too much to take

207
00:48:28.900 --> 00:48:32.700
My protest as to why he put me here

208
00:48:32.701 --> 00:48:36.600
Careful with that dear...
... makes a terrible bang

209
00:48:37.100 --> 00:48:39.700
Open the blades and they're active

210
00:48:40.000 --> 00:48:41.200
Good to know

211
00:48:45.200 --> 00:48:50.200
Viktor put you here for a reason but
I doubt its because you had moral qualms

212
00:48:50.201 --> 00:48:52.800
- What do you know?
- Very little of anything...

213
00:48:52.801 --> 00:48:53.800
... I'm afraid

214
00:49:00.000 --> 00:49:04.600
Oh, then perhaps I may be mistaken,
then there's no use for you at all

215
00:49:04.601 --> 00:49:06.900
Markus was after this
Why?

216
00:49:49.400 --> 00:49:51.600
Some history is based on truth...

217
00:49:52.400 --> 00:49:53.600
... and others on deception

218
00:49:55.900 --> 00:49:59.400
Viktor was not the first of our
kind as you were led to believe

219
00:49:59.401 --> 00:50:03.400
He was once human,
ruler of his lands

220
00:50:05.200 --> 00:50:09.700
Markus,
he's the one

221
00:50:11.000 --> 00:50:15.300
The source,
the first true Vampire

222
00:50:16.000 --> 00:50:18.300
So the legend is true

223
00:50:19.000 --> 00:50:21.300
Toward the end of his ruthless life

224
00:50:22.900 --> 00:50:27.200
his next breath meant more to
Viktor than silver or gold

225
00:50:27.201 --> 00:50:31.800
Markus came with an offer,
a reprieve ...

226
00:50:32.500 --> 00:50:35.500
... from sickness and death
Immortality

227
00:50:36.400 --> 00:50:40.800
In return, Viktor was to use his
army turned immortal to protect him

228
00:50:40.801 --> 00:50:41.900
To do what?

229
00:50:42.400 --> 00:50:44.600
To defeat the very first werewolves

230
00:50:45.000 --> 00:50:50.200
A dangerous and very infectious breed
Created by Markus's own flesh and blood

231
00:50:52.200 --> 00:50:54.000
His twin brother William

232
00:50:55.800 --> 00:51:00.200
But these weren't the Lycans we know
disgusting as your brethren may be ...

233
00:51:00.201 --> 00:51:04.500
... they at least are evolved
No these were raging monsters

234
00:51:04.509 --> 00:51:07.600
Never able to take human form again

235
00:51:07.609 --> 00:51:10.400
It's only the later generations that
learned to channel their rage

236
00:51:10.601 --> 00:51:14.600
And William's appetite for destruction
and rampage was insatiable

237
00:51:15.800 --> 00:51:20.200
He had to be stopped,
So once Viktor's army was turned ...

238
00:51:20.201 --> 00:51:24.700
... the legions of Vampires under his control
tracked down and destroyed the animals

239
00:51:25.500 --> 00:51:29.000
Then captured William and locked him away

240
00:51:29.200 --> 00:51:31.700
Viktor's prisoner for all time

241
00:51:34.000 --> 00:51:35.200
Why let him live?

242
00:51:35.201 --> 00:51:38.200
For the same reason why Viktor
never conspired against Markus

243
00:51:38.201 --> 00:51:39.400
Fear

244
00:51:39.900 --> 00:51:46.500
He was warned if Markus should ever be killed,
all those in his blood line would follow him to the grave

245
00:51:46.600 --> 00:51:51.100
So in Viktor's mind, William's death would
be the end for all Lycans ...

246
00:51:51.101 --> 00:51:52.400
... his slaves

247
00:51:53.900 --> 00:51:55.200
Yes

248
00:51:56.500 --> 00:52:01.499
Yes a clever deception
but one Viktor was hardly willing to put to the test

249
00:52:02.900 --> 00:52:06.400
So Markus was protected,
at all costs

250
00:52:10.500 --> 00:52:13.900
Ah yes, here we are

251
00:52:16.900 --> 00:52:19.400
- Vampires?
- Mortals

252
00:52:20.300 --> 00:52:22.600
Men loyal to Alexander Corvinus

253
00:52:25.100 --> 00:52:27.100
The father of us all

254
00:52:33.900 --> 00:52:34.900
What's this?

255
00:52:39.000 --> 00:52:43.000
You should know,
It's William's prison

256
00:52:45.400 --> 00:52:49.100
The prison your father was
commissioned to build

257
00:52:54.100 --> 00:52:57.400
"So you've been the one keeping
a watch over this for me have you"

258
00:53:04.600 --> 00:53:05.600
What is it?

259
00:53:06.500 --> 00:53:07.800
what's wrong?

260
00:53:08.700 --> 00:53:12.500
She now understands why her
family was killed

261
00:53:14.600 --> 00:53:16.800
But that was many years later

262
00:53:17.900 --> 00:53:21.700
The winter of Lucian's escape,
your father knew too much

263
00:53:22.000 --> 00:53:24.200
or too much for Viktor to risk

264
00:53:24.201 --> 00:53:29.400
Especially when Lucian had the
key to William's cell

265
00:53:31.000 --> 00:53:33.800
And I'm the map

266
00:53:34.000 --> 00:53:35.800
Yes

267
00:53:36.100 --> 00:53:40.400
The only one still living who
has seen its location

268
00:53:41.100 --> 00:53:44.600
Oh Viktor realized you'd be too
young to remember explicitly ...

269
00:53:44.603 --> 00:53:51.100
... but Markus knows that the memory and
therefore the exact location of Williams prison ...

270
00:53:51.300 --> 00:53:53.300
... is hidden away in your blood

271
00:53:54.500 --> 00:53:58.300
Why is Markus looking for him now?
After all this time?

272
00:53:58.800 --> 00:54:00.700
That I cannot answer

273
00:54:11.100 --> 00:54:16.300
But I do know someone who could stop him,
perhaps I could arrange a meeting

274
00:54:16.500 --> 00:54:20.800
In exchange for your discretion
of course

275
00:54:22.100 --> 00:54:23.000
Of course

276
00:55:16.200 --> 00:55:18.900
Tanis, you seem anxious

277
00:55:19.700 --> 00:55:22.300
Why do you flee the very sight of me?

278
00:55:27.300 --> 00:55:30.000
Please, sit

279
00:55:32.100 --> 00:55:35.900
There's no need for this to
be unpleasant

280
00:55:35.900 --> 00:55:38.700
I always rather enjoyed
your company

281
00:55:44.100 --> 00:55:45.500
Now you're being rude

282
00:55:47.300 --> 00:55:48.900
Sorry

283
00:55:56.600 --> 00:56:01.000
Viktor struck 2 keys,
what do you know of them?

284
00:56:02.400 --> 00:56:07.800
Keys?
I don't know of any keys

285
00:56:22.490 --> 00:56:25.800
Oh yes, those keys

286
00:56:28.500 --> 00:56:33.400
Yes?
One was kept in plain sight...

287
00:56:33.500 --> 00:56:36.400
... draped around his daughters neck

288
00:56:36.500 --> 00:56:39.400
- Right there for you to see
- And the other?

289
00:56:41.400 --> 00:56:44.200
- Kept with Viktor at all times
- Where?

290
00:56:45.300 --> 00:56:46.100
Within him

291
00:56:48.400 --> 00:56:50.300
Beneath the flesh

292
00:57:17.200 --> 00:57:19.300
... perhaps I could arrange a meeting

293
00:57:19.301 --> 00:57:22.400
... go to pier 17, ask for Lorenz Macaro

294
00:57:45.500 --> 00:57:52.300
- How do you know he's not just setting us up?
- He's not brave enough to set me up

295
00:58:15.300 --> 00:58:16.100
You can go

296
00:58:26.200 --> 00:58:27.900
You're familiar with this then?

297
00:58:35.500 --> 00:58:36.600
Intimately

298
00:58:43.600 --> 00:58:45.400
You are Alexander Corvinus

299
00:58:50.600 --> 00:58:54.800
There was a time when I
was known by that name

300
00:58:56.200 --> 00:58:59.900
By any name I am still
your forefather

301
00:59:05.200 --> 00:59:08.300
How have you stayed hidden
all these years?

302
00:59:08.500 --> 00:59:13.900
For centuries I have stood by and watched
the havoc my sons have brought upon each other ...

303
00:59:13.901 --> 00:59:15.400
... and upon humanity

304
00:59:17.100 --> 00:59:22.400
Not the legacy I prayed for the morning
I watched them enter this world

305
00:59:22.401 --> 00:59:27.300
And a tiresome duty!
Keeping the war contained, cleaning up the mess

306
00:59:28.500 --> 00:59:31.900
Hiding my family's unfortunate history

307
00:59:32.200 --> 00:59:35.000
- Couldn't you have stopped it?
- Yes ...

308
00:59:35.300 --> 00:59:40.200
- Could you kill your own sons?
- You know what Markus will do?

309
00:59:40.201 --> 00:59:43.000
If he finds me, he finds William's prison

310
00:59:43.200 --> 00:59:46.600
You need to help us stop him

311
00:59:46.601 --> 00:59:50.400
You are asking me to help you
kill my son?

312
00:59:50.401 --> 00:59:54.000
You?  A Death Dealer?

313
00:59:54.400 --> 00:59:58.200
How many innocents did killed in the
6 century quest to avenge your family?

314
00:59:58.201 --> 01:00:02.800
Spare me your self-righteous declarations,
you are no different from Markus

315
01:00:02.801 --> 01:00:05.200
And even less noble than William

316
01:00:05.700 --> 01:00:08.700
At least he cannot control
his savagery

317
01:00:08.701 --> 01:00:11.800
Anything I've done can be
laid at your feet

318
01:00:11.801 --> 01:00:14.900
Hundreds of thousands have died
because of your inability to accept ...

319
01:00:14.901 --> 01:00:16.800
... that you sons are monsters!

320
01:00:16.900 --> 01:00:19.200
That they create monsters!

321
01:00:19.201 --> 01:00:20.450
You could have stopped all of this

322
01:00:20.451 --> 01:00:26.000
Don't come groveling to me simply
because you are weaker than your adversary

323
01:00:26.001 --> 01:00:28.700
You know the devastation William
caused before he was captured

324
01:00:28.701 --> 01:00:30.700
He cannot be set free

325
01:01:16.100 --> 01:01:17.900
No, wait!

326
01:01:18.100 --> 01:01:20.600
You're no match for him

327
01:01:41.500 --> 01:01:43.400
Soon, brother

328
01:02:32.900 --> 01:02:36.400
They're gone...
... there, there, my child, you are safe now

329
01:03:23.600 --> 01:03:25.600
No, Michael

330
01:03:26.700 --> 01:03:28.400
Look at me!

331
01:03:29.700 --> 01:03:31.100
Michael!

332
01:05:05.200 --> 01:05:06.800
Hello father

333
01:05:07.700 --> 01:05:10.200
You are unwelcomed in my presence

334
01:05:11.400 --> 01:05:16.000
Ah, the predictable heart,
that never thaws

335
01:05:17.200 --> 01:05:20.300
Pity it beats within such a fool

336
01:05:21.100 --> 01:05:23.100
The eldest of the immortals...

337
01:05:23.500 --> 01:05:27.600
... yet you have made no attempt
to seize your destiny

338
01:05:27.601 --> 01:05:31.100
We are oddities of nature
you and I

339
01:05:31.201 --> 01:05:32.600
Nothing more

340
01:05:32.700 --> 01:05:35.200
This is a world for humanity

341
01:05:35.201 --> 01:05:39.700
And that petty sentiment explains
why you rejected your sons?

342
01:05:39.701 --> 01:05:45.300
Why you stood by for half a millennium
as William suffered alone in darkness?

343
01:05:45.900 --> 01:05:51.200
No father, I have no sympathy
for your petty sentiment

344
01:05:53.400 --> 01:05:56.300
Viktor's key ... where is it?

345
01:05:56.600 --> 01:06:00.600
Whatever plan you have for William
is futile, you cannot control him

346
01:06:00.601 --> 01:06:02.900
Oh I am stronger now

347
01:06:03.301 --> 01:06:05.900
And our bond is greater than
you've ever wanted to acknowledge

348
01:06:05.901 --> 01:06:10.450
You're wrong, soon you'll be drowning
in Lycans just like before

349
01:06:10.471 --> 01:06:14.000
Not Lycans father or vampires

350
01:06:14.500 --> 01:06:18.500
A new race, created in the image
of their maker

351
01:06:20.000 --> 01:06:20.900
Their new god

352
01:06:24.300 --> 01:06:25.400
Me

353
01:06:37.700 --> 01:06:39.900
And a true god ...

354
01:06:44.500 --> 01:06:46.600
... has no father

355
01:07:20.800 --> 01:07:22.800
You will fail

356
01:07:56.800 --> 01:07:58.600
- Get the kit!
- No!

357
01:08:05.400 --> 01:08:08.100
Please sir, let us help you

358
01:08:09.300 --> 01:08:12.000
The time has come my friend

359
01:08:12.700 --> 01:08:14.500
Find the girl ...

360
01:08:15.400 --> 01:08:16.900
... bring her to me

361
01:08:22.800 --> 01:08:24.000
No, wait, wait

362
01:08:27.700 --> 01:08:32.200
If you want Markus, you will
need Alexander's help

363
01:08:36.700 --> 01:08:38.300
Don't leave him here

364
01:08:57.800 --> 01:08:59.900
- Did he get the pendant?
- Yes

365
01:09:02.200 --> 01:09:04.400
He's too powerful for you alone

366
01:09:05.100 --> 01:09:09.300
You're the only one older than
he is, the only one stronger

367
01:09:09.500 --> 01:09:11.200
You could have killed him yourself

368
01:09:13.000 --> 01:09:16.100
No matter what he's become ...

369
01:09:17.000 --> 01:09:20.100
... he is my son

370
01:09:24.600 --> 01:09:26.100
You are the last hope left

371
01:09:28.100 --> 01:09:30.800
There is only one way to
defeat him

372
01:09:38.300 --> 01:09:44.300
Quickly now, before there is no
more legacy left in my veins

373
01:09:52.500 --> 01:09:54.100
What will I become?

374
01:09:56.200 --> 01:09:58.900
The future

375
01:10:39.000 --> 01:10:40.500
Go now

376
01:14:19.100 --> 01:14:20.100
We're getting close

377
01:15:13.400 --> 01:15:15.200
Head back around towards the river

378
01:15:26.900 --> 01:15:29.000
I don't see a way inside

379
01:15:31.300 --> 01:15:34.000
There used to be a river
entrance just there

380
01:15:34.200 --> 01:15:36.000
It must be submerged now

381
01:15:36.001 --> 01:15:38.400
Looks like we're getting wet

382
01:16:11.900 --> 01:16:12.500
Closer!

383
01:16:18.800 --> 01:16:20.300
Selene!

384
01:17:30.500 --> 01:17:31.490
William ...

385
01:17:46.600 --> 01:17:47.000
Wait

386
01:17:52.900 --> 01:17:54.700
No William stop!

387
01:17:54.800 --> 01:17:56.300
Be still brother

388
01:17:56.800 --> 01:17:58.000
It's me

389
01:18:01.400 --> 01:18:04.200
I'd no sooner harm you than myself

390
01:18:35.400 --> 01:18:36.200
Which way?

391
01:19:03.100 --> 01:19:04.000
Is this it?

392
01:19:09.000 --> 01:19:10.400
He's already here

393
01:19:43.300 --> 01:19:46.200
- What is it?
- Nothing

394
01:19:46.900 --> 01:19:48.200
Let's go

395
01:19:59.000 --> 01:20:00.600
We're too late

396
01:20:38.100 --> 01:20:38.900
Impressive

397
01:21:45.900 --> 01:21:47.400
Michael you're unique

398
01:21:49.500 --> 01:21:52.300
There's never been a hybrid before

399
01:21:52.850 --> 01:21:55.300
You powers could be limitless

400
01:22:11.400 --> 01:22:12.300
Hold it!

401
01:22:17.400 --> 01:22:20.400
- Where is he?
- He went right through there

402
01:22:21.700 --> 01:22:24.400
All we have is UV rounds,
it won't take him down

403
01:22:24.402 --> 01:22:26.480
No, but it'll slow him down

404
01:23:11.100 --> 01:23:12.400
Let's go

405
01:23:12.800 --> 01:23:13.500
You alright?

406
01:26:18.400 --> 01:26:23.400
No these are not the lycans you know ...
... raging monsters ... unable to take human form ever again

407
01:27:10.900 --> 01:27:11.900
What are you waiting for?

408
01:27:11.901 --> 01:27:13.300
Shoot 'em!

409
01:27:13.301 --> 01:27:15.300
I can't, not without taking
her out!

410
01:27:15.401 --> 01:27:17.300
I can't get a shot!

411
01:28:06.200 --> 01:28:07.800
Michael

412
01:28:42.400 --> 01:28:43.000
Take him down!

413
01:30:56.900 --> 01:30:57.500
William!

414
01:31:08.500 --> 01:31:13.000
I knew Viktor made a mistake
by keeping you as a pet

415
01:31:13.001 --> 01:31:16.900
He should have killed you
with the rest of you family

416
01:33:57.500 --> 01:33:59.700
An unknown chapter lies ahead

417
01:34:00.600 --> 01:34:04.200
The lines that have divided the
clans has now been blurred

418
01:34:04.201 --> 01:34:07.200
Chaos and infighting are inevitable

419
01:34:07.201 --> 01:34:10.900
All that is certain is that
darkness is still ahead

420
01:34:10.901 --> 01:34:14.000
But for now for the first time

421
01:34:14.601 --> 01:34:18.000
I look into the light with new hope
